\[\begin{align}
&\text{RMSSE} = \frac{1}{\sqrt{\frac{1}{T-1}\sum_{t=1}^{T-1} \Delta^2_t}}\text{RMSE} \\
&\text{where}\;\; \text{RMSE} = \sqrt{\frac{1}{h}\sum_{j=1}^h e^2_{t+j}}
\end{align}\]

\(\Delta_t\) is the first differences of the in-sample values
Used in the M5 Competition
